<%- layout("layout/boilerplate") %>

    <style>
        body {
            background: #eef2f7;
            font-family: sans-serif;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            background: #fff;
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        h1 {
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        h4 {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        p,
        li {
            color: #555;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container my-5">

        <h1 class="text-center mb-4">Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-center text-muted">Effective Date: 2026</p>

        <p>This platform acts as a marketplace that connects Hosts and Guests. By accessing or using our services, you
            agree to comply with these Terms.</p>

        <h4>Platform Nature</h4>
        <p>We do not own, control, or manage any properties listed. All agreements are directly between users.</p>

        <h4>User Accounts</h4>
        <p>You are fully responsible for your account activity. Any misuse may result in suspension.</p>

        <h4>Bookings</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>Guests must review listings carefully</li>
            <li>Hosts must provide accurate information</li>
            <li>We are not liable for misunderstandings</li>
        </ul>

        <h4>Payments</h4>
        <p>All payments must be completed through the platform. External transactions are strictly prohibited.</p>

        <h4>Cancellation Policy</h4>
        <p>Each host defines their own cancellation rules. Refunds depend on those rules.</p>

        <h4>Prohibited Use</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>Fraud or fake listings</li>
            <li>Harassment or illegal activities</li>
            <li>Bypassing platform payments</li>
        </ul>

        <h4>Liability</h4>
        <p>We are not responsible for property damage, personal injury, or disputes between users.</p>

        <h4>Account Termination</h4>
        <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts without notice.</p>

        <h4>Changes</h4>
        <p>We may update these Terms at any time.</p>

    </div>
</body>